{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/7e0dbe491ba2bd13852bf6083cc8de83.avif?t=1764153422\" alt=\"Once upon a time...\" width=760 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026there was a <strong>hero</strong> entering a dungeon, like so many did before them. But this one - <strong>you!</strong> - is not up for murder. They're looking for a <strong>job</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mops &amp; Mobs</strong> is set in the bowels of a <strong>multi-level labyrinth</strong> whose monsters you are going to meet in <strong>critical moments</strong> of their lives - as the dungeon recently was inherited by a new owner who doesn\u2019t quite know what he\u2019s doing. But it\u2019s not just the dungeon\u2019s <strong>leader who is struggling</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lich lady lamenting her past, a gelatinous cube befallen by an existential crisis, the prison guard longing for immortality - even the bridge troll is being kept from his purpose\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/e6740d2ac35d744b35b4bd2e91001f4a.poster.avif?t=1764153422\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/e6740d2ac35d744b35b4bd2e91001f4a.webm?t=1764153422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And just when you thought you understood what\u2019s going on, <strong>an ancient war is looming</strong>, threatening to break out and tear the dungeon apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help your new colleagues - or follow your <strong>secret mission</strong> instead and search the dungeon\u2019s rooms and corridors for the artifact?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/15771e9b694db266ffca7ab6bae68dae.avif?t=1764153422\" alt=\"what are you up to?\" width=760 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon master hires you as a <strong>janitor</strong>, but you\u2019re more than that: a <strong>crisis manager</strong>, really. <br><strong>Talk</strong> to all the monsters, get to know them, find out how they\u2019re doing. <strong>Decorate</strong> their rooms as they like them. <strong>Explore</strong> the caves and architecture of the dungeon and <strong>repair</strong> the most horrific decay. <strong>Investigate</strong> the conspiracy that puts every inhabitant into danger - and <strong>prepare</strong> to fight alongside them, for the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweeping and wiping</strong> is the easy part. In <strong>Mops &amp; Mobs</strong> you will make your way through the depths of the dungeon by talking, thinking, and the <strong>occasional mini-games of decorating rooms and playing cards</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/0b9d81402b991150edec9cf1932399b9.avif?t=1764153422\" alt=\"\"width=760 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a cast of charmingly unhinged monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a retro-styled dungeon in a juicy dungeon crawler manner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, repair, and redecorate rooms for monsters and vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with collectible cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the twist on a beloved setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secret of a forgotten war in detective manner</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2851050?t=1764153422","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764153422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/21aee9888213561c478d7c4f37972b6633e4c492/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764153422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/21aee9888213561c478d7c4f37972b6633e4c492/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764153422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3064340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/7e0dbe491ba2bd13852bf6083cc8de83.avif?t=1764153422\" alt=\"Once upon a time...\" width=760 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026there was a <strong>hero</strong> entering a dungeon, like so many did before them. But this one - <strong>you!</strong> - is not up for murder. They're looking for a <strong>job</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mops &amp; Mobs</strong> is set in the bowels of a <strong>multi-level labyrinth</strong> w