k</strong> to all the monsters, get to know them, find out how they\u2019re doing. <strong>Decorate</strong> their rooms as they like them. <strong>Explore</strong> the caves and architecture of the dungeon and <strong>repair</strong> the most horrific decay. <strong>Investigate</strong> the conspiracy that puts every inhabitant into danger - and <strong>prepare</strong> to fight alongside them, for the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweeping and wiping</strong> is the easy part. In <strong>Mops &amp; Mobs</strong> you will make your way through the depths of the dungeon by talking, thinking, and the <strong>occasional mini-games of decorating rooms and playing cards</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/extras/0b9d81402b991150edec9cf1932399b9.avif?t=1764153422\" alt=\"\"width=760 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a cast of charmingly unhinged monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a retro-styled dungeon in a juicy dungeon crawler manner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, repair, and redecorate rooms for monsters and vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with collectible cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the twist on a beloved setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secret of a forgotten war in detective manner</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rat King Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851050/e68642fe0f431d83a99f21dd1e31c2dc043d0d24/header.jpg?t=1764153422","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved \u00a9 Rat Ki